#: ../../source/reference/abbreviations.rst:3
msgid "Abbreviation Handling"
msgstr "Meðhöndlun skammstöfunar"

#: ../../source/reference/abbreviations.rst:10
msgid "How abbreviation detection works"
msgstr "Hvernig skammstöfunargreining virkar"

#: ../../source/reference/abbreviations.rst:12
msgid ""
"Snapper uses Unicode UAX #29 sentence boundary detection as a baseline. UAX "
"#29 sometimes splits at periods that belong to abbreviations rather than "
"sentence endings. Snapper post-processes the split results, merging segments "
"where the break occurred at a known abbreviation."
msgstr ""
"Snapper notar Unicode UAX #29 setningarmarkaskil sem grunn. UAX #29 skiptir "
"stundum við punkta sem tilheyra skammstöfunum frekar en setningalokum. "
"Snapper eftirmeðhöndlar skiptiniðurstöðurnar og sameinar hluta þar sem "
"skiptingin átti sér stað við þekkta skammstöfun."

